A bind needs no right on the units.
A capability narrowed to name units without the right to use them would bind all the same;
a thread's units were bound through a capability with the right to bind.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: thread's units are malformed

